# Comb is developed from two checkouts of this repo: a Windows desktop and an
# aarch64 Linux box. Normalizing to LF in the repository *and* in every working
# tree keeps the two byte-identical, so corpus files and benchmark inputs
# compare cleanly across machines and no checkout ever shows phantom
# whole-file diffs. RustRover, rustfmt and cargo all handle LF natively.
* text=auto eol=lf
